    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_machine_s_s_a_updater" kindref="compound">MachineSSAUpdater</ref> - This class updates SSA form for a set of virtual registers defined in multiple blocks. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is used when code duplication or another unstructured transformation wants to rewrite a set of uses of one vreg with uses of a set of vregs. </para>
